> Conclusion

The compact run selects epoch27 at validation AP50 .043582. All held-out AP metrics are zero, with800 detections across23 digits/eight scenes. The bounded schedule has not produced a useful held-out detector; falling training loss and the visible thin/mislocalized boxes expose the failure.

Independent objective/assignment fixtures precede full-graph checks and compact whole-model fitting. Fit-only priors, multiscale geometry and paired BN restoration are explicit, while actual held-out results and boxes retain errors without a benchmark claim.

> References

- [Redmon and Farhadi (2018), YOLOv3: An Incremental Improvement](https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02767).
- [Authors’ YOLOv3 configuration](https://github.com/pjreddie/darknet/blob/master/cfg/yolov3.cfg).
